        "id": 1073546
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-29T20:48:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it be sufficient for us to add:\n\n\"@export(name\u003d\"android_buffer_metadata_v4_0_t\", value_prefix\u003d\"HAL_BUFFER_METADATA_\",\n        export_parent\u003d\"false\")\"\n\nIs there any other additional support needed to make extending this easier?",
