      "writtenOn": "2019-08-28T16:49:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can put a copy of it in android.hardware.graphics.common but we can\u0027t remove it from  android.hardware.graphics.common unless we do a major rev of composer. We weren\u0027t planning on doing a major rev for composer this year.\n\nI am concerned that having a copy in two places will make it even more confusing and it could be hard to convert between the two types.",
